          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అనుకోకుండా — anukōkuṇḍā — \"unexpectedly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బజారులో అనుకోకుండా మా మాస్టారు కనిపించారు. bajārulō anukōkuṇḍā mā māsṭāru kanipiñcāru. I unexpectedly ran into our teacher in the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The negative of అనుకో, to think: without thinking of it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అనుకోకుండా (anukōkuṇḍā) is native Telugu: anukonu, \"to think\" (DEDR 868), with -kuṇḍā, \"without -ing\": without having thought of it."
            }
          ]
        },
