              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉన్నట్టుండి — unnaṭṭuṇḍi — \"out of the blue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉన్నట్టుండి వర్షం మొదలైంది. unnaṭṭuṇḍi varṣaṁ modalaindi. Out of the blue it started to rain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally while being as it was: all was calm, and then it was not."
            }
          ]
        },
